[size=2][b]REV1.9.4 TRACE V2 — 2026-10-22 — Public beta[/b][/size]
Full 4-mode mod (Stock ATGM / EMP / Neural Breach / Cyber Hack) over the verified REV1.9.1 logic base, plus a capture-local diagnostic trace layer (per-target logs to bin\FagotM2_debug.log; no global AI hooks, no gameplay changes vs REV1.9.1).
[list]
[*]Modes: Stock ATGM · EMP (~45 s suspension) · Neural Breach «Schizo» (yellow ally) · Cyber Hack «Takeover» (player control)
[*]Safety: hash-gated installer (baseline logic.dll SHA256 29EB…6044), verified backup + one-command rollback
[*]Known beta issue: residual AI on some Takeover-captured units (robots/spiders)
[/list]
